WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.820
breaking overnight police in Germany say a hostage&nbsp;
situation at a large shopping mall is over but it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:10.320
is not clear if the suspect was captured police&nbsp;
warned people to avoid the neighborhood in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.540
eastern city of Dresden including the popular&nbsp;
Christmas Market an armed man was said to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:21.120
holding an undetermined number of people there&nbsp;
were reports that the gunman first tried to break&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:27.180
into a radio station and opened fire he reportedly&nbsp;
then ran into the nearby shopping mall a woman was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:33.120
found dead in another part of the city police&nbsp;
say her son may be the suspected hostage taker

